comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-03T08:27:55.048Z","harness:codex","text=GH-879 evidence: scheduled run 30793921402 at main bbbc13b58 failed only Windows Node 24 in agent-runtime-primitives.spec.ts because the session probe returned model null; macOS, Ubuntu, and Node 22 passed. The failure directly reproduces this canonical slug-encoding defect. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/879"
  "2026-08-03T08:38:47.116Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: the Claude session resolver now applies the harness character-class mapping, replacing every character outside ASCII letters, digits, and hyphen. The fixture contains both a space and underscore and uses an independently specified real-layout directory rather than production slug logic. Focused suite passed 13/13. A sandboxed fresh pm mutation from this repository, with Codex signals removed and a real local Claude session selected, recorded harness:claude-code plus model claude-opus-5 and version 2.1.220 with source probe; no session identifier or private content was retained or recorded."
  "2026-08-03T09:06:52.118Z","harness:codex","PR evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/880 closes GH-879 with cross-platform Claude slug compatibility, independent fixture coverage, and real-layout provenance acceptance."
