close_reason: Resolved GH-879 by matching Claude's complete project-directory slug character class and replacing the self-confirming fixture with an independent cross-platform underscore/space layout. Focused tests passed 13/13 and a sandboxed fresh mutation against a real local Claude layout recorded non-null model and version provenance from the probe.
